0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2016</span><span style=\"COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 8</span><span style=\"COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월인 학생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(3</span><span style=\"COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">~4</span><span style=\"COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기 재학생 또는 휴학생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2) </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fa