: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">추천 진행되는 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">\"</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">자동차 마니아 추천</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">\"</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">분야는 학교</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학점</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">영어점수 입력 없이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">자동차 연구개발 실력</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만으로 평가가 진행되며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만약 지원자의 자질이 현저히 부족할 경우</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">향후 동일한 채용 전형에서 본교의 추천 권한을 제한한다고 합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 1</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">차적으로 취업지원본부에서 지원자의 자질을 평가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">첨부파일</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">의 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">“</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">동아리 활동 및 수상내역</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">을 기준으로 평가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">할 예정이며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">부족하다고 판단될 경우 추천자로 선정되지 않을수 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><o:p></o:p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
